{"title": "Antimagic Susceptibility", "pageid": 4382, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Antimagic_Susceptibility", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Bloom\" title=\"Sussur Bloom\">Sussur Bloom</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Antimagic Susceptibility</b> is a passive feature that renders the creature incapacitated and unable to act when within an antimagic field.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Held together by the Weave itself, this armour is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Incapacitated\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\">Incapacitated</a> by antimagic fields. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Animated_Armour\" title=\"Animated Armour\">Animated Armour</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Klank\" title=\"Klank\">Klank</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Krank\" title=\"Krank\">Krank</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"><a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\">Incapacitated</a> by antimagic fields.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715013340\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 770/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4361/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2151/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 244/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643748/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   33.530      1 -total\n 96.87%   32.482      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 40.50%   13.579      1 Template:Cond\n 29.14%    9.770      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 27.94%    9.367      1 Template:Icon_link\n 26.95%    9.037      1 Template:Icon_text\n 23.29%    7.809      2 Template:Trim\n 20.60%    6.908      1 Template:Ifempty\n 15.69%    5.262      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.89%    3.317      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4382-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715013340 and revision id 293119. Rendering was triggered because: diff-page\n -->\n</div>"}